==Icelandic==
===Etymology===
From the {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|gröftr|lang=non}}, cognate with the Old English {{term|gräft|lang=ang}}.

===Noun===
{{is-noun|m|graftar}}

# the act of [[digging]]
# the act of [[engraving]]
# [[pus]]
# [[burial]], [[interment]]
# [[remains]] dug up from a grave

====Declension====
{{is-decl-noun-m-s3|gr|a|ft|u=u|pl=-}}
Note: in the dative and genitive, the forms ''greftri'' and ''graftrar'', respectively, are sometimes used.

